[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 242.309, "timestamp": "00:04:02", "text": "你好。  你好。這段聲音能聽見嗎？這是可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 243.429, "timestamp": "00:04:03", "text": "聽到的嗎？  是的。  是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 250.22899999999998, "timestamp": "00:04:10", "text": "，你的聲音清晰可聞。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 251.99, "timestamp": "00:04:11", "text": "你好，布拉德。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 255.27, "timestamp": "00:04:15", "text": "上帝。我的天啊。你好，騎師。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 257.43, "timestamp": "00:04:17", "text": "朋友，你好嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 261.03, "timestamp": "00:04:21", "text": "我一切都很好。已經過去一段時間了。  他表現非常出色。我們走吧。  是的。  我們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 265.189, "timestamp": "00:04:25", "text": "走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 282.95, "timestamp": "00:04:42", "text": "哦，天哪。他一直在做這件事。看看他。看看他。瞧瞧他，他正坐在辦公桌前。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 285.83, "timestamp": "00:04:45", "text": "你在盯著什麼？你在盯著我看嗎？  你在跟我分享什麼？  哦，該死。  我的寶貝，你最近過得怎麼樣？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 288.111, "timestamp": "00:04:48", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "suppp bread"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 290.31, "timestamp": "00:04:50", "text": "你最近過得怎麼樣？  我一直都很好。"}]